# vercel: `yarn vercel` links the repo root, and the Vercel CLI appends `.env*` on the first link unless this exact line exists.
# `.env*` ignores env files at any depth, including ones Next.js lets you commit like `.env.production`; add a `!` line to commit one.
.vercel
.env*
!.env.example
